1419
01:14:43,701 --> 01:14:44,789
So what...
ສະນັ້ນຫຍັງ...

1420
01:14:45,921 --> 01:14:46,965
Tachyons.
Tachyons.

1421
01:14:47,139 --> 01:14:48,619
A squall of tachyons.
